"""
evan_miya_reference.py — Evan Miya BPR data for backtesting / calibration.

Column order on evanmiya.com BPR leaderboard:
  rank | name | team | adj_obpr | adj_dbpr | adj_bpr | possessions |
  raw_obpr | raw_dbpr | raw_bpr | on_court_ortg | on_court_drtg | net_rtg | value_extra

Columns 4-6 (adj_*) are the schedule-adjusted BPR values — primary comparison target.
Columns 8-10 (raw_*) are raw RAPM estimates before schedule adjustment.
Possessions ≈ total on-court possessions across all games (not raw minutes).

To add a new season: paste the raw leaderboard text into RAW_DATA[year] following
the same format as 2026.

Usage:
    from ncaa.analytics.player_value.bpr.evan_miya_reference import load_em_ratings
    df = load_em_ratings(season_year=2026)
"""

